      "structure_description": "The cationic Sm33 metal–oxo cluster is assembled from two Sm14 units linked by a Sm2 unit, carbonate anions, and an additional disordered Sm ion. The Sm14 units themselves contain square-pyramidal Sm5 and octahedral Sm6 building units."
